WEBVTT

00:10:26.235 --> 00:10:30.555
or crowd out nonmarket values and attitudes

00:10:30.555 --> 00:10:32.914
worth caring about.

00:10:32.914 --> 00:10:35.138
Once we see

00:10:35.138 --> 00:10:38.849
that markets and commerce,

00:10:38.849 --> 00:10:42.510
when extended beyond the material domain,

00:10:42.510 --> 00:10:47.960
can change the character of the goods themselves,

00:10:47.960 --> 00:10:50.521
can change the meaning of the social practices,

00:10:50.521 --> 00:10:53.985
as in the example of teaching and learning,

00:10:53.985 --> 00:10:58.631
we have to ask where markets belong

00:10:58.631 --> 00:11:00.562
and where they don't,